{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56515","headline":"巨胜歌（幷序） 四 · 柳冲用","name":"巨胜歌（幷序） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尽言水土金，三物成大药。\n假气递相生，相生复相烁。\n黄芽不是铅，元向铅中作。\n举东已合西，戊己爲囊橐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳冲用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}